; zero_test.asm - generated by make_zero_test.py: the zero reference calibration value, Last Human's
; sequence (page 1) and the UVMC2 SDK's (page 2). Buttons 1 / 2 pick the page.
; Build: lwasm --format=raw -o zero_test_raw.bin zero_test.asm, then pad to 32768 bytes with $FF.

